  "text": "Second, protect your prompt cache prefix. Keep static instructions, tools, and docs at the very top of your prompt. Never put a dynamic timestamp at byte zero, or you will bust the cache on every request. And route simple, verbose tasks to smaller models, saving heavy reasoning budgets for genuinely hard steps.",
